SUMMARY:Union Congregational Church: Congregational Generosity Event
DESCRIPTION:Click here to RSVP: https://bit.ly/unioncongtea or call Marcie Wallace at 973-945-5891. \nA Little Something Extra To Say Thank You For Your Pledge\n \nJoin Us At Union Cong’s GenerosiTEA Party: Tea\, Treats\, And Raffle Prizes\nSaturday\, June 6th from 3pm-5pm. In The Assembly Room \nIn addition to a delightful afternoon of tea\, treats\, and special music\, each person who attends the tea will receive a raffle ticket for our exciting in-person raffle. Additional tickets will be available at the door to further support church missions and ministries. Prizes include a cruise with Armen around Sandy Hook Bay\, a weekend in the Poconos\, a day at Deer Lake\, Wine and Wheel with Rev. Katrina at the art museum\, and gift cards to the Turtle and the Wolf and Hometown Arcade. \nCome to the GenerosiTea and allow us to shower you with appreciation\, tea sandwiches\, scones…and the chance to win! There will also be crafts for kids at the event. \nRSVP at https://bit.ly/unioncongtea or call Marcie Wallace at 973-945-5891.
URL:https://www.unioncong.org/event/union-congregational-church-congregational-generosity-event/
LOCATION:Union Congregational Church\, 176 Cooper Avenue\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07043\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Church Events,All Events,Featured Events
ORGANIZER;CN="Union Congregational Event":MAILTO:contact@unioncong.org
END:VEVENT
